OL,3,AFive more arrests in wrong-way crash
OL,4,Ainvestigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive more people have been arrested in
OL,7,Fan investigation into a wrong-way crash
OL,8,Fon the A66 in Middlesbrough which
OL,9,Fkilled seven people, including two
OL,10,Fpolice officers.
OL,12,FCleveland Police said a 16-year-old boy
OL,13,Fand two men, 18 and 21, were arrested
OL,14,Fon suspicion of participating in an
OL,15,Forganised crime group. A 55-year-old
OL,16,Fman was also arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fassisting an offender and a 23-year-old
OL,18,Fman on suspicion of making threats to
OL,19,Fkill.
OL,21,FAll five remain in custody.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
