OL,3,ALockerbie bombing trial postponed days
OL,4,Abefore it was due to start
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trial of a Libyan man over the
OL,7,FLockerbie bombing has been postponed
OL,8,Ffor a third time, after new evidence on
OL,9,Fthe 37-year-old case came to light
OL,10,Fthree days ago.
OL,12,FJury selection was due to get under way
OL,13,Fin Washington DC on Wednesday but the
OL,14,FBBC understands a new start date has
OL,15,Fbeen set for January next year.
OL,17,FLawyers acting for Abu Agila Mas'ud
OL,18,FKheir Al-Marimi said "newly discovered
OL,19,Fevidence" previously unknown to the
OL,20,Fdefence and prosecutors from the US
OL,21,Fgovernment emerged on Friday 21 August.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
