OL,3,ATornado tears through French village,
OL,4,Aleaving dozens hurt and homes ravaged
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tornado has torn through the village
OL,7,Fof Pomas in south-west France, injuring
OL,8,F39 people and damaging hundreds of
OL,9,Fhomes.
OL,11,FAuthorities said 15 people were taken
OL,12,Fto hospital and two were in a critical
OL,13,Fcondition. One man said his pregnant
OL,14,Fwife was injured after their house
OL,15,Fcollapsed on her.
OL,17,FMore than 120 emergency workers were
OL,18,Fdeployed to the village south of
OL,19,FCarcassonne after winds reaching
OL,20,F117km/h (73mph) tore roofs off houses
OL,21,Fand damaged an estimated 300 homes on
OL,22,FMonday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
